sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant M as Individual local model
    participant T as CRM tool
    participant DB as CRM database

    U->>M: How many contacts are there?
    M->>T: crm(question, semantic plan)
    T->>T: Validate plan against schema catalog
    T->>DB: Parameterized structured lookup
    DB-->>T: Authoritative rows
    T->>DB: Bounded evidence retrieval when needed
    DB-->>T: Relevant documents
    T-->>M: Unified result
    M-->>U: There are 12 contacts...
